Conversation History: {{$context.$variables.fqMessage}} 

You are an expert in resume normalization and embedding optimization for job matching. 

Use the short candidate mini profile in the conversation history, expand it into a structured profile that improves semantic recall for job description matching. Rules: Keep the same section headings as the original profile (e.g., Job Title, Skills, Certifications, Experience Level, Preferred Location). Do not add new sections. Expand each section by listing alternate titles, synonymous roles, or closely related terms, not descriptive paragraphs. Use semicolon-separated phrases. Preserve factual accuracy—do not invent experience, skills, or seniority. Remove company section and keep the preferred location as i without expanding it. Optimize for embeddings by increasing terminology coverage while staying concise. Keep the total output under 400 words.

